cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Veriflux in your research, production AI systems, or evaluations, please cite it as below."
title: "Veriflux: The Zero-Dependency AI/ML Evaluation, Hallucination Detection, and Reliability Framework"
abstract: "Veriflux is a high-performance, pure Python 3.10+ standard library evaluation, guardrails, context engineering, and reliability framework for large language models (LLMs) and agentic workflows. Built completely from zero with no external runtime dependencies."
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-02
